to decide what your next goal is going to be, and the system-driven gameplay invites you to find your own solutions to achieving these goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/b0b7087dc03d6cf7acb7882450ec75da.poster.avif?t=1770040190\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/b0b7087dc03d6cf7acb7882450ec75da.webm?t=1770040190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/b0b7087dc03d6cf7acb7882450ec75da.mp4?t=1770040190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy yet eerie adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s early spring. The air is fresh, yet something in the silence feels... wrong. Overgrown paths, strange noises, stories half-forgotten. Raven Brooks is warm and familiar, but unsettling in ways you can\u2019t quite name. As you explore, you\u2019ll uncover memories long buried, pieces of stories half-remembered. Relive the thrill of discovering something on your own... that unmatched satisfaction of achieving the goal not through guidance, but through your own intuition and curiosity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/638b46faef2ce6bcba8ac03bf4eec56f.poster.avif?t=1770040190\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/638b46faef2ce6bcba8ac03bf4eec56f.webm?t=1770040190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/extras/638b46faef2ce6bcba8ac03bf4eec56f.mp4?t=1770040190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Nikita Kolesnikov","tinyBuild"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789680/3a9c8859a18ca436dfe4529c28c48d604d449138/header.jpg?t=1770040190","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2789680/177978939/e619e8e97e8f1c77b8ec5da511f954a22de7fca8/1750900296/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748366433","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2789680/177978939/e619e8e97e8f1c77b8ec5da511f954a22de7fca8/1750900296/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748366433","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2789680/177978939/e619e8e97e8f1c77b8ec5da511f954a22de7fca8/1750900296/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748366433","id":257146524,"name":"Prototype 2 Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146524/f74fb4b4ba7239fee551d8dcf8908c35549bd8f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748366433"}],"name":"Hello Neighbor 3","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 770 and up<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["tinyBuild"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,